        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gabrielle Anwar, Bob Newhart, Jane Curtin, Olympia Dukakis\n- Works: The Librarian: Return to King Solomon's Mines, The Button-Down Mind of Bob Newhart\n- Topics: Bob Newhart's career\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1960s, Bob Newhart came to prominence with the comedic monologue album The Button-Down Mind of Bob Newhart.\n- The Button-Down Mind of Bob Newhart became a worldwide bestseller and reached number one on the Billboard pop album chart.\n- The Button-Down Mind of Bob Newhart remains the 20th-best-selling comedy album in history.\n- Gabrielle Anwar, Bob Newhart, Jane Curtin, and Olympia Dukakis co-starred in The Librarian: Return to King Solomon's Mines.",
